        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WARNING:</strong> This game may potentially trigger seizures for people diagnosed with photosensitive epilepsy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912370/extras/1196913a957ac608e0e39658ae86bbb0.poster.avif?t=1778106060\" width=628 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912370/extras/1196913a957ac608e0e39658ae86bbb0.webm?t=1778106060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912370/extras/1196913a957ac608e0e39658ae86bbb0.mp4?t=1778106060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>BEERCRUSH</strong></i> is a psychotic, fast-paced roguelike where you need to drink beer to stay alive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the profoundly average <strong>John Beer</strong> to jump, slide, and boost your way through crazy worlds! Use your incredible  alcoholism to stay alive by chugging beer, gain new abilities by talking to Kyle, and get to the bottom of... whatever is going on here.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Improve your abilities with Bottlecaps!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912370/extras/3acb22f7b0c8cf56fdae3fd43b39c5af.poster.avif?t=1778106060\" width=630 height=470 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912370/extras/3acb22f7b0c8cf56fdae3fd43b39c5af.webm?t=1778106060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912370/extras/3acb22f7b0c8cf56fdae3fd43b39c5af.mp4?t=1778106060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escaping a world will grant you an upgrade to your abilities, known as <strong>Bottlecaps</strong>! Mix and match up to three of them to your liking to blow past future worlds with ease!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DRINK BEER!!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912370/extras/17653cf46438cd0f88b09784ef8ce148.poster.avif?t=1778106060\" width=630 height=470 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912370/extras/17653cf46438cd0f88b09784ef8ce148.webm?t=1778106060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912370/extras/17653cf46438cd0f88b09784ef8ce148.mp4?t=1778106060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every world has a unique beer drinking minigame. Some are easier than others... you'll need to master them all to stay alive and get to where you're going!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8+ frantic, procedurally generated worlds to chug beer in!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ Bottlecaps, equip these to gain new abilities ranging from a shield of beer to a shotgun!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3+ Gamemodes, each providing a unique take on John Beer's adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable Borders to customize your experience!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rockin' original soundtrack, perfect for getting your stomach pumped!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is also beer.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So go ahead! <strong>LIVE LIFE!</strong> <strong>EVERY GOLDEN MINUTE OF IT!!</strong></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WARNING:</strong> This game may potentially trigger seizures for people diagnosed with photosensitive epilepsy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912370/extras/1196913a957ac608e0e39658ae86bbb0.poster.avif?t=1778106060\" width=628 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912370/extras/1196913a957ac608e0e39658ae86bbb0.webm?t=1778106060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912370/extras/1196913a957ac608e0e39658ae86bbb0.mp4?t=1778106060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>BEERCRUSH</strong></i> is a psychotic, fast-paced roguelike where you need to drink beer to stay alive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the profoundly average <strong>John Beer</strong> to jump, slide, and boost your way through crazy worlds! Use your incredible  alcoholism to stay alive by chugging beer, gain new abilities by talking to Kyle, and get to the bottom of... whatever is going on here.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Improve your abilities with Bottlecaps!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912370/extras/3acb22f7b0c8cf56fdae3fd43b39c5af.poster.avif?t=1778106060\" width=630 height=470 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912370/extras/3acb22f7b0c8cf56fdae3fd43b39c5af.webm?t=1778106060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912370/extras/3acb22f7b0c8cf56fdae3fd43b39c5af.mp4?t=1778106060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escaping a world will grant you an upgrade to your abilities, known as <strong>Bottlecaps</strong>! Mix and match up to three of them to your liking to blow past future worlds with ease!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DRINK BEER!!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912370/extras/17653cf46438cd0f88b09784ef8ce148.poster.avif?t=1778106060\" width=630 height=470 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912370/extras/17653cf46438cd0f88b09784ef8ce148.webm?t=1778106060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912370/extras/17653cf46438cd0f88b09784ef8ce148.mp4?t=1778106060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every world has a unique beer drinking minigame. Some are easier than others... you'll need to master them all to stay alive and get to where you're going!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8+ frantic, procedurally generated worlds to chug beer in!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ Bottlecaps, equip these to gain new abilities ranging from a shield of beer to a shotgun!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3+ Gamemodes, each providing a unique take on John Beer's adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable Borders to customize your experience!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rockin' original soundtrack, perfect for getting your stomach pumped!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is also beer.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So go ahead! <strong>LIVE LIFE!</strong> <strong>EVERY GOLDEN MINUTE OF IT!!</strong></p>",
        "short_description": "Enter the world of John Beer in this psychotic, fast-paced roguelike where you drink beer to stay alive! Dash as fast as you can through unique and crazy worlds to break the vicious cycle. So what are you waiting for!? LIVE LIFE. EVERY GOLDEN MINUTE OF IT!",
